@node lsfsres___FileSystem_resource_entry_lister "lsfsres - FileSystem.resource entry lister"
@{b}@{u}lsfsres - FileSystem.resource entry lister@{uu}@{ub}

@{fg shine}lsfsres@{fg text} lists every entry in @{fg shine}FileSystem.resource@{fg text} : DosType, version,
SegList address, and handler name. A @{fg shine}[ROM]@{fg text} / @{fg shine}[RAM]@{fg text} tag shows whether the
handler lives in Kickstart ROM or was loaded from disk.

@{b}Use cases@{ub}:
  * Confirm a ROM-resident filesystem (e.g. fat95 baked into a Kickstart bundle)
    registered itself at boot.
  * Spot whether a mounted volume is using the ROM copy or a disk copy of a
    handler.

----------------------------------------
